@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC23 Nghe thuyet minh va audio duoc bao ve

actor "Khach co guest access pass" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebPublicUI - PoiDetailPage, TourRoutePage, MapPage va ProtectedAudioPlayer" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nPublicAudioTourController + PublicAudioController + PublicAudioTourService + PublicAccessService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nGuestAccessPassRepository + AudioTrackRepository + PoiRepository + TourRepository + TourPoiRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo POI/tour va chon nghe
UI -> UI: Lay access token da luu
UI -> Business: Gui token, POI/tour id va ngon ngu
Business -> DataAccess: Tim pass theo token hash
DataAccess -> Database: Doc GuestAccessPass va QrLocation
Database --> DataAccess: Tra pass
DataAccess --> Business: Tra du lieu pass
Business -> Business: Kiem tra Active, han dung va scope
alt Token thieu, sai hoac het han
  Business -> DataAccess: Cap nhat Expired neu can
  DataAccess -> Database: Ghi trang thai pass
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra loi khong duoc xac thuc
  UI --> Actor: Xoa pass va hien thi het han
else Pass khong cho phep POI/tour
  Business --> UI: Tra loi khong co quyen
  UI --> Actor: Yeu cau chon goi phu hop
else Pass hop le
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI/tour, narration va AudioTrack active
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc noi dung va quan he TourPoi
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu audio tour
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra metadata
  Business --> UI: Tra narration va danh sach track theo ngon ngu
  Actor -> UI: Bam phat mot track
  UI -> Business: Gui token va audioTrackId de stream
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc track va kiem tra lai scope POI
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc AudioTrack, POI va pass
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu
  alt Track active, POI public, file MP3 hop le va dung scope
    Business --> UI: Stream file audio co ho tro tua
    UI --> Actor: Phat audio
  else Track/file khong ton tai hoac khong hop le
    Business --> UI: Tra khong tim thay hoac file loi
    UI --> Actor: Hien thi audio chua san sang
  end
end
@enduml
